OL,3,AFather leaves 7-year-old son alone on
OL,4,AMount Fuji to continue hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a mountain hut found the child
OL,7,Fnear the sixth station of a hiking
OL,8,Froute towards the summit and alerted
OL,9,Fpolice. His father was tracked down
OL,10,Fbetween the route's seventh and eighth
OL,11,Fstations - said to be a three-hour hike
OL,12,Faway.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
